 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I asked Ruth about the pantry run — Ruth's gone. Still need hands. Are you in?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. Nobody's worked the creek bend, past the treeline in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "There is no playable joint foraging outing yet. Giving food does not perform the promised outing."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "They settle — not warm, not cold. Just two people talking."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Right. I get it.\" A beat — and then the subject is closed. They won't raise it again."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I should go before I say something sincere.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Okay. I'll manage on my own.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"We're eating through stores faster than we replace them. Forage with me tomorrow? I know the east treeline.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"The stores won't stretch past tomorrow, and I'm not choosing who eats. I know the east treeline — come with me and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "There is no playable joint foraging outing yet. Giving food does not perform the promised outing."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"What's the most useful thing you've learned since we got here?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"The fundamental skill. Everything else is decoration.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "You say nothing. The silence sits at the fire with everyone else."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"And... scene. Good talk.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Remember me kindly, or remember me loudly. Either works."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Counted."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Fame is just being remembered by strangers. I'll take it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Do something worth retelling. That's the whole plan. The rest is logistics.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"You said the most useful thing you learned is being hungry and going anyway. Still the lesson?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You say nothing. The silence sits at the fire with everyone else."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "Counted."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Well. My social battery is officially dead.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "When I'm gone, I want the story to keep my name in it."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You walk to the cache spot with Regina. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Someday kids will sit by a fire and hear what I did. I want it to be a good one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Still on what they want.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "A warmth settles over the conversation — they lean in a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"It's quiet today. Wrong kind of quiet.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"BROTHERS! That's The Union Rep telling you it's about to move. It hunts by day — watch the open ground.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Sunbasker — Its scales go from dull brown to molten gold. It hunts by day — watch the open ground.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Thanks. ...Thanks for saying that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"That's the whole of it. The director's cut adds nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. They're really talking to you now."
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"The people who mattered are the ones still talked about. I'm working on it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"As I said — Still on what they want.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Anyway — that's my cross to carry. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what they want.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"I hate to ask this, but whatever this is, it's getting worse — I'm feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Can you do anything?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Rest won't touch this. The heat's climbing and my head's full of cotton. Someone who knows what they're doing — please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "A flicker at the corner of their mouth. Not quite a smile. Not quite anything."
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "A wall comes down, then — surprisingly — a door opens behind it. \"I'm not from Denver. I'm from Tucson, Arizona. You don't know what it's like, being the only nobody in a camp of somebodies.\" Quiet. Real."
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Right. I get it.\" A beat — and then the subject is closed. They won't raise it again."
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Still on that favor.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "Owen looks at you, level. \"I told you the truth. You can keep poking it, but it's told.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  }
 ],
