    "bearerSample": [
     "Valeria sets out to find Domingo. \"Won't be long.\"",
     "◈ THE GRANT — full integration. The System opens the last slot like a door it built just for Domingo. \"You have been adequate entertainment. We upgrade adequate.\" (Ability slots: 6)"
    ],
    "giftSample": [
     "💛 You hold Brass Locket. Brass. Two photos inside, both fading. It opens with a click you can feel in your teeth — Patricia's click, then your mother's, now yours. Your gifts are not mastered — but t"
    ],
    "rumorSample": [],
    "crisisSample": [
     "◈ Something in Regina's eyes has changed. They've seen enough out there to stop being afraid of the dark.",
     "◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)",
     "SYSTEM: Deep integration. You see the world through us now."
    ]
   },
